# Extension patterns

## Flow

Popup → content script scrapes job page → background service worker → `POST /api/extension/capture` with bearer token → creates/updates `jobs` + `applications`.

## Key files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `src/content/job-detector.ts` | Page detection, trigger scrape |
| `src/content/scrapers.ts` | DOM scrapers per board |
| `src/content/scrapers-logic.ts` | Pure parse/normalize logic (unit-tested) |
| `src/background/service-worker.ts` | API calls, token storage |
| `popup/popup.ts` | User actions, status |
| `src/shared/types.ts` | Payload shapes aligned with web API |

## Conventions

- Keep **pure extraction logic** in `scrapers-logic.ts` with Vitest tests (`scrapers-logic.test.ts`)
- `scrapers.ts` is DOM-only; delegate normalization to logic module
- Types must stay in sync with `apps/web/app/api/extension/capture/route.ts` and `lib/extension/merge-capture-fields.ts`
- Scrapers break on DOM changes — prefer structured selectors; page-dump fallback exists for manual recovery

## Dev

```bash
cd apps/extension && pnpm build   # or package.json scripts
pnpm test                         # vitest in extension package
```

Auth tokens are managed in web Settings (`components/settings/extension-tokens.tsx`).
